uild your answer"},{"t":81.4,"txt":"around one of these story buckets. Keep"},{"t":83.5,"txt":"it simple [music] and try not to drift."},{"t":85.9,"txt":"Using this approach helps increase"},{"t":87.5,"txt":"clarity, aligns [music] with core areas"},{"t":89.8,"txt":"AI is scanning for, prevents tangents,"},{"t":92.5,"txt":"and boosts keyword density. By focusing"},{"t":95.1,"txt":"on one story type, [music] you naturally"},{"t":97,"txt":"include terms the AI is searching for"},{"t":99.2,"txt":"without sounding robotic. AI"},{"t":100.8,"txt":"interviewers struggle to infer, so"},{"t":103.5,"txt":"directness [music]"},{"t":104.2,"txt":"is key. For example, if the position"},{"t":106.8,"txt":"states attention to detail, [music]"},{"t":108.8,"txt":"time management, and organization as key"},{"t":111.1,"txt":"skills, our response should look"},{"t":113.2,"txt":"something like this. I excel [music] at"},{"t":115.1,"txt":"time management, attention to detail,"},{"t":117.4,"txt":"and organization."},{"t":119.3,"txt":"It may feel awkward being so on the"},{"t":121.4,"txt":"nose, but that is exactly the type of"},{"t":123.5,"txt":"thing AI is listening for in a screening"},{"t":125.6,"txt":"interview."},{"t":126.8,"txt":"AI is trained to scan for keywords, just"},{"t":129.2,"txt":"like an ATS scans for [music] them in"},{"t":130.8,"txt":"your resume."},{"t":134.6,"txt":"Let's take a look at some of these tips"},{"t":136.3,"txt":"in practice and how you can use the STAR"},{"t":138.2,"txt":"method to formulate your responses."},{"t":140.8,"txt":"Describe a time you managed competing"},{"t":142.8,"txt":"priorities [music]"},{"t":143.6,"txt":"under pressure. Sure."},{"t":145.8,"txt":"Last year, my team had three product"},{"t":147.9,"txt":"deadlines land in the same week. I was"},{"t":150.2,"txt":"responsible for coordinating resources"},{"t":152.2,"txt":"and preventing delays. The key takeaway"},{"t":154.6,"txt":"is that I used structure and"},{"t":156.1,"txt":"transparency to prevent surprises."},{"t":158.6,"txt":"As a result, we launched on time, and"},{"t":161.3,"txt":"adoption rose by 18% in the first month."},{"t":164.8,"txt":"Be sure [music] to practice and time"},{"t":166.3,"txt":"these in advance. That answer works well"},{"t":169,"txt":"because it's structured, concise, and"},{"t":171.6,"txt":"uses a measurable result. Exactly what"},{"t":174.2,"txt":"AI is scoring for. Human interviewers"},{"t":176.6,"txt":"might infer your strengths, but AI need"},{"t":179.2,"txt":"you to say them outright. [music]"},{"t":181,"txt":"Luckily, unlike any human interview, AI"},{"t":183.6,"txt":"will often allow you to redo the answer"},{"t":185.8,"txt":"one to three times."},{"t":190.1,"txt":"Another area always worth paying"},{"t":192,"txt":"attention to for virtual interviews is"},{"t":194.2,"txt":"your environment. [music]"},{"t":195.3,"txt":"Let's take another look at our"},{"t":196.8,"txt":"interviewee's space and see how many"},{"t":198.7,"txt":"boxes they checked."},{"t":215.9,"txt":"A steady eye line is encouraged,"},{"t":218.1,"txt":">> [music]"},{"t":218.2,"txt":">> but if staring at the lens feels"},{"t":219.6,"txt":"unnatural, tape a small photo or arrow"},{"t":222.2,"txt":"behind it, [music] a trick many career"},{"t":224,"txt":"coaches recommend. Ah, there. Much"},{"t":226.8,"txt":"better. Speaking of eye contact, be sure"},{"t":229.4,"txt":"to deliver your answers as naturally as"},{"t":231.6,"txt":"possible, as if you were speaking"},{"t":233.5,"txt":"directly to a human hiring manager."},{"t":235.1,"txt":"[music]"},{"t":235.7,"txt":"AI is more forgiving than you expect."},{"t":237.9,"txt":"The evaluation focuses more on skills"},{"t":239.7,"txt":"[music]"},{"t":240.3,"txt":"and experience matching, as well as your"},{"t":242.5,"txt":"clarity and energy. You've got the"},{"t":244.6,"txt":"insight and the structure. Now you're"},{"t":246.7,"txt":"ready to face your next AI interview"},{"t":248.7,"txt":"with confidence and come out on